Wed Sep 23 19:06:46 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.11.0 (includes 0.10.0):
  * MCP server self-exits after idle timeout; omit
    git:clean from find_files output
  * Faster per-platform file walking and gitignore matcher;
    follow_symlinks exposed for SDK/MCP/python paths
  * Skip only the binary file instead of its whole bigram
    chunk; enforce_time_budget for zero-match searches
  * Parse file:line after Windows drive letters; compare
    relative paths over 512 bytes; keep path shortening on
    char boundaries; dotted numbers are not file filters
  * Neovim: open all multi-selected files, winborder
    override, multi-word preview highlight fix
- Refresh the vendored dependencies

