Mon Sep 14 15:35:21 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package, version 0.9.4: libfff_c, the C ABI of the fff
  fuzzy file finder, built against the distribution's libgit2
  (opencode's file search loads it through bun:ffi); fff-c's unit
  tests run, fff-core's integration tests do not
